OL,3,ANew Strictly hosts explain their roles
OL,4,Aas they reject 'roving presenter'
OL,5,Areports
OL,6,
OL,7,F"No one's replacing anybody - at the
OL,8,Fminute it's all very kind of open,"
OL,9,FWillis told Richard Osman on The Rest
OL,10,Fis Entertainment podcast.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
